WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:01.302
- Before we say goodbye,

00:00:01.302 --> 00:00:05.130
we'd like to play a quick
round of Drewth or Dare.

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:06.605
You get to ask me anything

00:00:06.605 --> 00:00:08.378
or dare me to do anything.

00:00:08.378 --> 00:00:09.303
And I go there.

00:00:09.303 --> 00:00:11.198
So Chloe, here you are.

00:00:11.198 --> 00:00:12.266
How are you today?

00:00:12.266 --> 00:00:13.274
- I'm great, how are you?

00:00:13.274 --> 00:00:14.330
- You look lovely.

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:15.163
- Thank you.

00:00:15.163 --> 00:00:16.804
- You're welcome, Drewth or dare?

00:00:16.804 --> 00:00:17.637
- Dare

00:00:17.637 --> 00:00:18.470
- Do it.

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:19.303
What, what, what do I do?

00:00:19.303 --> 00:00:21.711
- So I've had a really old
voicemail for my whole life

00:00:21.711 --> 00:00:24.999
and I dare you to record
my voicemail for me.

00:00:24.999 --> 00:00:27.098
- I would be honored to.

00:00:27.098 --> 00:00:29.057
Okay, give me your phone.

00:00:29.057 --> 00:00:30.017
- [Chloe] Okay.

00:00:30.017 --> 00:00:31.100
- Okay, okay.

00:00:33.329 --> 00:00:35.249
Hi, this is Drew Barrymore.

00:00:35.249 --> 00:00:39.497
I'm recording the outgoing
message for Chloe's inbox.

00:00:39.497 --> 00:00:41.005
Please leave a message

00:00:41.005 --> 00:00:44.155
but also remember to have a wonderful day.

00:00:44.155 --> 00:00:46.135
Thank you so much.

00:00:46.135 --> 00:00:47.785
(audience applauds)

00:00:47.785 --> 00:00:49.963
I felt a lot pressure.

00:00:49.963 --> 00:00:52.555
I really wanted to get it right.

00:00:52.555 --> 00:00:54.638
Oh gosh, thank you Chloe.

00:00:55.952 --> 00:00:59.797
Thank you for letting me
a part of your voicemail.

00:00:59.797 --> 00:01:02.380
(upbeat music)

